      "requestAttempts": 2,
      "pronunciationText": "Last one. An atom has three energy levels, at zero, two and five units of energy. Which photon energies can it emit, when an electron drops from one level to a lower one? Explain why it can't emit a photon with four units of energy. Pause here to answer.",
