      "requestAttempts": 1,
      "pronunciationText": "The possible drops are five to two, two to zero, and five to zero. So the photon energies are three, two and five units. Four isn't the gap between any pair of levels, so no single drop can make it, and there's no line at four units. Listing only two and five is the classic slip. Don't forget the drop between the two upper levels.",
